  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Sree Sreenath built a career at Case Western Reserve University in electrical engineering, computer science, complex systems, and global development. His work connected systems biology, sustainability, water and energy policy, international education networks, and Indian community organizing, linking technical research with civic service and global problem solving."
